{"id":"bca56618509beeda","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-simple.md","title":"Simple Set","display":"df-simple — Simple Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-simple","aliases":["57-df-simple"],"display":"df-simple — Simple Set","depends_on":["[[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]","[[57-df-infinite]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[57-df-W-e]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-simple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-simple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple — Simple Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f2c37860ff19d3b\" href=\"?note=9f2c37860ff19d3b\" title=\"57-df-recursively-enumerable\">57-df-recursively-enumerable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"267cc3f5b1df77c9\" href=\"?note=267cc3f5b1df77c9\" title=\"57-df-infinite\">57-df-infinite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b1118344012e3e87\" href=\"?note=b1118344012e3e87\" title=\"57-df-W-e\">57-df-W-e</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}\\)</span> (简单集谓词, 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bca56618509beeda\" href=\"?note=bca56618509beeda\" title=\"57-df-simple\">57-df-simple</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\omega\">\\(A \\subseteq \\omega\\)</span> (自然数子集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>-th r.e.集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b1118344012e3e87\" href=\"?note=b1118344012e3e87\" title=\"57-df-W-e\">57-df-W-e</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Infinite}(\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Infinite}(\\cdot)\\)</span> (无限谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"267cc3f5b1df77c9\" href=\"?note=267cc3f5b1df77c9\" title=\"57-df-infinite\">57-df-infinite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\cdot)\\)</span> (有限谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"267cc3f5b1df77c9\" href=\"?note=267cc3f5b1df77c9\" title=\"57-df-infinite\">57-df-infinite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1\\)</span> (r.e.集类, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f2c37860ff19d3b\" href=\"?note=9f2c37860ff19d3b\" title=\"57-df-recursively-enumerable\">57-df-recursively-enumerable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple} \\vdash \\mathrm{Simple}(A) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; A \\in \\Sigma^0_1 \\;\\land\\; \\mathrm{Infinite}(\\omega \\setminus A) \\;\\land\\; \\forall e \\in \\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Infinite}(W_e) \\to W_e \\cap A \\neq \\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple} \\vdash \\mathrm{Simple}(A) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; A \\in \\Sigma^0_1 \\;\\land\\; \\mathrm{Infinite}(\\omega \\setminus A) \\;\\land\\; \\forall e \\in \\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Infinite}(W_e) \\to W_e \\cap A \\neq \\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>简单集：递归可枚举但其补无限且与每个无限递归可枚举集相交</li>\n<li>Post问题的早期解之一，提供了递归可枚举集的真子集层次</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-recursively-enumerable","status":"resolved","id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-infinite","status":"resolved","id":"267cc3f5b1df77c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-infinite]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-W-e","status":"resolved","id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-W-e]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"bca56618509beeda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Simple}$ (简单集谓词, 见 [[57-df-simple]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"a630d8a1dcde994c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A \\subseteq \\omega$ (自然数子集, see [[57-df-omega]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-W-e","status":"resolved","id":"b1118344012e3e87","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_e$ ($e$-th r.e.集, see [[57-df-W-e]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-infinite","status":"resolved","id":"267cc3f5b1df77c9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Infinite}(\\cdot)$ (无限谓词, see [[57-df-infinite]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-infinite","status":"resolved","id":"267cc3f5b1df77c9","anchor":"ref-9"